= November 2021

[? if not abortion_law_enacted:
The border confrontation, a preventable maternal death and Independence Day
all demand something from us at once. Humanitarian teams, frightened patients
and our street organisers will each remember which demand we treated as real.?]
[? if abortion_law_enacted: The border confrontation and Independence Day
demand two different kinds of public courage. Humanitarian teams and our
