@nov21_uniforms
title: Defend personnel while investigating unlawful orders
on-arrival: border_doctrine = "Officer protection with individual accountability"; military_trust += 3; police_trust += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; minority_safety += 2; far_right_agenda -= 1; public_mood_pending_border_security_support += 6; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support -= 2; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 5; news_headline = "Uniforms and unlawful orders are separated"

The line between institution and abuse is made explicit: service is protected,
illegal commands are not. The security debate cools, but accountability now
has to be followed case by case.

