@nov21_monitor
title: Fund legal observers and victim protection
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Legal monitoring"; independence_monitor_years += 1; police_trust += 2; minority_safety += 4; constitutional_restraint += 2; media_capacity += 1; civic_patriotism += 1; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 8; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 3; news_headline = "Observers document the march without granting it a monopoly"

Lawyers and stewards prioritise evidence, escorts and incident logs over
symbolic confrontation. The result is quieter than a rally, but it creates
usable records for courts, media and local safety networks.

