@nov21_ban
title: Demand prohibition of the nationalist march
on-arrival: independence_march_strategy = "Ban the nationalist march"; progressive_credibility += 2; constitutional_restraint -= 2; konf_poll_momentum += 0.4; far_right_street_capacity += 5; far_right_agenda += 3; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_support += 10; public_mood_pending_refugee_solidarity_backlash += 8; public_mood_pending_national_security_salience += 6; news_headline = "A prohibition fight gives the march a martyr story"

The legal offensive signals zero tolerance, but the right weaponises the case
as proof of persecution. Even a procedural win risks expanding the myth it was
meant to contain.

