@nov21_konf
# prose-audit: Grade A — The premise quotes the actual county-meeting and Telegram language ("executioners", "foreign agents") so the threat is specific rather than categorical, and expose, protect and dismiss each end in a different organisational fact.
title: Pandemic channels become a radical-right campaign machine
face-image: img/poland/events/pres-candidate-mentzen.webp
new-page: true
view-if: november_2021_konf_done = 0
on-arrival: november_2021_konf_done = 1; konf_org_resources += 1; covid_anti_system_pressure += 2

= November 2021 — Rage is getting organised

Konfederacja organisers tie anti-vaccine messaging to anti-left rhetoric and
abortion backlash. In county meetings and Telegram channels, doctors are called
"executioners," women's-strike volunteers "foreign agents," and left councillors
"enemies of Polish families." The campaign frame is no longer only taxes and
lockdowns. It is social conflict with named targets.

- @nov21_konf_expose
- @nov21_konf_protect
- @nov21_konf_dismiss

@nov21_konf_expose
title: Expose the network and name the intimidation chain
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The monitoring team lacks legal and media capacity.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_capacity += 3; constitutional_restraint += 2; feminist_trust += 2; minority_safety += 2; konf_poll_momentum -= 0.15; news_headline = "Lewica publishes the anti-left intimidation chain behind Konfederacja's campaign"

Lewica publishes local examples, legal classifications and repeat organisers.
The dossier denies the right's claim that intimidation is only spontaneous
internet language and gives threatened activists a documented route to report.

- @november_2021_hub: Return to the November desk

@nov21_konf_protect
title: Build clinic, school and activist protection protocols
on-arrival: local_network += 3; minority_safety += 4; feminist_trust += 3; police_trust += 1; public_trust += 2; konf_poll_momentum += 0.05; news_headline = "The Left builds local protection against anti-left intimidation"

Municipal offices, schools, women's organisations and legal volunteers receive
shared reporting and safety procedures. The language still circulates online,
but fewer people face it alone.

- @november_2021_hub: Return to the November desk

@nov21_konf_dismiss
title: Treat it as online theatre and stay on other files
on-arrival: konf_poll_momentum += 0.3; far_right_agenda += 2; feminist_trust -= 2; minority_safety -= 2; news_headline = "Konfederacja hardens anti-left language without sustained answer"

The party treats the messaging as self-marginalising noise. By winter, the same
accounts are feeding local rallies with a clearer enemy list and better turnout.

- @november_2021_hub: Return to the November desk

@nov21_finish
title: Close the November desk
view-if: november_2021_sajbor_done = 1 and november_2021_border_done = 1 and independence_2021_done = 1 and november_2021_konf_done = 1
on-arrival: november_2021_done = 1

November belonged to the frontier and the funeral. A woman dead in a Pszczyna
hospital, a state of emergency keeping doctors and journalists out of the
border strip, and a march the city again failed to prevent. The desk closes on
three arguments the country has not finished having.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue
